FMYHT4D": {"rating": 4.5, "reviews": 478, "bullets": ["3 LIDS: Each water bottle comes with three lids allowing you to choose how you hydrate. Flip straw for one-handed hydration, a wide mouth twist cap for quick sips, and a flip chug lid for fast-flow hy", "KEEPS COLD ALL DAY: Double-walled and vacuum insulated to keep drinks cold up to 20 hours. Stay hydrated no matter where life takes you.", "100% LEAK-PROOF: Bottle features a secure, leak-proof screw on seal, allowing you to toss it in your bag worry-free.", "TRAVEL FRIENDLY: Take your water bottle wherever life takes you, thanks to the built in carry handle. Attach it to your backpack, gym bag, or carry it by hand.", "EASY TO CLEAN: Lid is top rack dishwasher safe, which makes cleaning a breeze. While we recommend hand washing the body for optimal longevity, feel free to toss it in the dishwasher if you prefer. All"]}, "B08ZCM11J6": {"rating": 4.5, "reviews": 24389, "bullets": ["Light-Up Fun: Features over 100 LED lights on the stem, deck, and wheels for a bright, exciting ride that boosts visibility and safety", "Smooth and Stable Ride: Low deck design and shock-absorbing 4\" wheels offer easy balance and a smooth glide; rear foot brake ensures quick, safe stops", "Adjustable for Growing Kids: Handlebar adjusts from 24.6\" to 33.3\" to accommodate riders as they grow; perfect for boys and girls ages 5 and up", "Lightweight and Foldable: Weighs under 7 pounds with a simple, no-tool folding mechanism for easy carrying, storage, and transport", "Built for Everyday Adventure: Supports riders up to 132 lbs and is designed to encourage outdoor fun, freedom, and exploration in every ride"]}}, "clips": {"B0DY1LB7XQ": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/1ac20f38-2cbb-4ab2-bc45-eeecbf64d447/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/ff4e5dd4-487f-4641-a540-b96d15d837de/default.vertical.jobtemplate.